[{"text":"FCVerbose is an option for numerous functions that allows to specify a local value of $VeryVerbose inside those functions. When set to a positive integer, all the debugging information inside the function will be given according to the value of FCVerbose, while the debugging output of other functions will be still governed by the value of $VeryVerbose. Following values are common","anchor":"fcverbose"},{"text":"1 - a brief description of the calculational steps including timings","anchor":"fcverbose"},{"text":"2 - somewhat more debugging information","anchor":"fcverbose"},{"text":"3 - lots of debugging output, probably useful only for developers","anchor":"fcverbose"},{"text":"Overview, $VeryVerbose.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"DiracSimplify[GA[\\[Mu], \\[Nu], \\[Rho], \\[Mu], \\[Nu]], FCVerbose -> 1]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Entering.}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Normal mode.}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Extracting Dirac objects.}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Done extracting Dirac objects, timing: }0.03636\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Doing index contractions.}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Index contractions done, timing: }0.000453\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Applying diracSimplifyEval}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: diracSimplifyEval done, timing: }0.01655\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Inserting Dirac objects back into products.}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{DiracSimplify: Done inserting Dirac objects back into products, timing: }0.000132\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examp